{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0About TrailRail</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to clear stages through simple controls such as moving left and right, jumping, and materializing the trajectory of their movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/6fc34a8194e95b6b28ffbca47b252956.poster.avif?t=1759437677\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/6fc34a8194e95b6b28ffbca47b252956.webm?t=1759437677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/6fc34a8194e95b6b28ffbca47b252956.mp4?t=1759437677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Envisioning the ideal trajectory and utilizing it well by pushing, pulling, and rotating is vital to clearing stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One key point to action-puzzle stages is discovering or stumbling upon new things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear all the stages and uncover this world's mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/ea07a75d14591c48d8d4a043f393700f.poster.avif?t=1759437677\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/ea07a75d14591c48d8d4a043f393700f.webm?t=1759437677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/ea07a75d14591c48d8d4a043f393700f.mp4?t=1759437677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/e8a283f73b8258944ecba7b4860c84d5.avif?t=1759437677\" width=496 height=701 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She woke up in a dilapidated laboratory, but can't remember who she is or why she's here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After realizing her name was &quot;Rail&quot; from the name embroidered in white on her coat, she embarks on a journey to escape the laboratory with the only remaining functioning robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/79101f0158bdcbab0d62033b44d19bee.avif?t=1759437677\" width=449 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robot that was in the laboratory where Rail woke up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can't speak, but seems like it's able to express its emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has the ability to materialize movement trajectory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Graphics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where civilization has fallen is depicted in beautiful pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/extras/525a269e3bfe24392426a137596d9f17.avif?t=1759437677\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846430?t=1759437677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846430?t=1759437677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846430/fcd77be09698005e638fb8eae54eb8ddf5f50a81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759437677","capsule